rom 1951 to 2025, 75 years on 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 years, the most of any pair, and June to July in 25. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in January to February and 53% in September to October. Every grid had its driest year in 1956, as low as 62% on grids 25967, 26267 and 26269.</p>"}
